---
import { getCollection, render } from 'astro:content';
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';

const projects = (await getCollection('projects')).sort(
  (a, b) => a.data.order - b.data.order,
);

const rendered = await Promise.all(
  projects.map(async (project) => ({
    project,
    Content: (await render(project)).Content,
  })),
);
---

<Base
  title="Open Source — blurt & yap | Sometimes Creek Ventures"
  description="blurt and yap: fully local push-to-talk dictation for macOS and Linux. Local AI, shipped as product."
>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 pt-14 sm:px-8 sm:pt-20">
    <h1
      class="font-display leading-[0.92] font-extrabold tracking-tight uppercase"
      style="font-size: clamp(2.6rem, 10vw, 7rem);"
    >
      Open <span class="outline-word">source</span><span class="text-accent"
        >.</span
      >
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-6 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-relaxed font-medium text-graphite">
      Two dictation tools, one thesis: local AI, shipped as product.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-14 space-y-14">
      {
        rendered.map(({ project, Content }) => (
          <section
            aria-labelledby={`project-${project.data.title}`}
            class="border-t-4 border-ink pt-6"
          >
            <div class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-x-6 gap-y-1">
              <h2
                id={`project-${project.data.title}`}
                class="font-display text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight uppercase"
              >
                {project.data.title}
              </h2>
              <p class="font-medium text-graphite">{project.data.tagline}</p>
            </div>
            <div class="prose-scv mt-4">
              <Content />
            </div>
            <ul class="mt-2 max-w-2xl space-y-2">
              {project.data.highlights.map((highlight) => (
                <li class="flex gap-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-graphite">
                  <span
                    aria-hidden="true"
                    class="mt-1.5 h-2.5 w-2.5 shrink-0 bg-accent"
                  />
                  {highlight}
                </li>
              ))}
            </ul>
            <p class="mt-6">
              <a
                href={project.data.repoUrl}
                class="text-sm font-bold tracking-wide text-ink uppercase underline decoration-accent decoration-4 underline-offset-4 hover:text-accent-deep"
              >
                {project.data.repoUrl.replace('https://', '')}
                <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
              </a>
            </p>
          </section>
        ))
      }
    </div>

    <div class="mt-16 max-w-2xl border-t-4 border-ink pt-6">
      <p class="leading-relaxed text-graphite">
        These aren't side projects. Talking to AI is now half of how engineers
        work, and typing speed is the bottleneck — so Sean built the tools that
        remove it. They connect directly to how Sometimes Creek Ventures
        delivers: the AI-augmented methodology proven in the
        <a
          href="/work/zonal"
          class="font-semibold text-ink underline decoration-accent decoration-2 underline-offset-3 hover:text-accent-deep"
        >
          Zonal performance rescue</a
        >, and enterprise voice-AI work for Chick-fil-A. Local AI, shipped as
        product.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>
